          "name": "proxy_worked_example",
          "description": "The worked example of `doc/design_proxy_node.md` section 6: a tool poised over a Si(100)-2x1 surface, the apex and the target atom both tagged `focus`, and the proxy cut around the pair. `proxy_6` and `proxy_7` are two members of a convergence series; `series` is the same cut driven by a `map` over a `range`, the form section 2 recommends for a whole series in one node.",
